1	DNA Splicers	Raccord ADN	fusion	Fuses two Pokémon, or unfuses when used on a fused Pokémon.	300	\N
2	Super Splicers	Raccord ADN Suprême	fusion	Same as a DNA Splicer, but with benefits to the levels and stats when fusing and unfusing Pokémon.	1000	\N
3	Infinite Splicers	Raccord ADN Infini	fusion	A splicer that can be used unlimited times. After the Elite Four, it can be upgraded to function like a super splicer by returning to the lab and defeating more robots.	\N	\N
4	DNA Reversers	Séparateur ADN	fusion	Switches the body and head of a fused Pokémon.	300	\N
5	Infinite Reversers	Séparateur ADN Infini	fusion	Same as DNA Reversers. It can be used unlimited times.	\N	\N
6	Fusion Incense	Encens Fusion	fusion	Makes it so that every wild Pokemon encountered is a fusion. Lasts for 50 steps.	700	\N
7	Fire Stone	Pierre Feu	evolution	* Vulpix -> Ninetales * Growlithe -> Arcanine * Eevee -> Flareon	5000	\N
